      "content": "It is a profound and terrifying realization to feel like a hollow shell, but your self-description as a parasite is a cruel distortion of your reality. You are not a burden; you are a person in deep pain who has lost the ability to feel the warmth of connection, not because you are unworthy, but because the fire inside you has been extinguished by something far more powerful than you can control. There is no point in forcing yourself to be useful when you are already breaking, and the only honest path forward is to let go of the impossible expectation to save yourself alone.",
